0:{"buildId":"A2KDDaJI2Oei_cuPJJym6","data":[{"rsc":["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","main",null,{"className":"blog-page","children":[["$","$L2",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"blog-article","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"shell blog-article-shell","children":[["$","$L3",null,{"className":"blog-back-link","href":"/blog","children":[["$","$L4",null,{"iconNode":[["path",{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7","key":"1l729n"}],["path",{"d":"M19 12H5","key":"x3x0zl"}]],"className":"lucide-arrow-left","size":16}]," All guides"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-tag","children":["Admissions"," · ","One Window archive"]}],["$","h1",null,{"children":"Is Your MBA Actually Worth It? The ROI Question Nobody Asks"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"blog-article-intro","children":"Every year, thousands of students spend months obsessing over one number: their target school’s ranking. They compare lists. They debate prestige. They build entire application strategies around the idea that if a school is ranked higher, it must automatically be the better decision. Almost none of them ask the question that actually matters:"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-article-body","children":[["$","section","Which MBA gets me specifically to where I want to go and how fast does it pay back?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Which MBA gets me specifically to where I want to go and how fast does it pay back?"}],[["$","p","That is the question that should shape the entire decision.",{"children":"That is the question that should shape the entire decision."}],["$","p","Because an MBA is not just an academic purchase. It is a career investment. And like any serious investment, it should be judged on return, not just reputation.",{"children":"Because an MBA is not just an academic purchase. It is a career investment. And like any serious investment, it should be judged on return, not just reputation."}],["$","p","This matters even more now because MBA applicants are making decisions in a tougher environment. Cost has become a bigger barrier, job-market uncertainty is more visible, and students are thinking much harder about whether the degree will actually change their trajectory. GMAC’s 2026 Prospective Students Survey found that 46% of candidates globally cited cost as a top barrier to graduate management education, while 20% cited uncertainty about job prospects after graduation. That tells you something important: applicants are no longer asking only, “Can I get in?” They are also asking, “Will this make financial and professional sense?”",{"children":"This matters even more now because MBA applicants are making decisions in a tougher environment. Cost has become a bigger barrier, job-market uncertainty is more visible, and students are thinking much harder about whether the degree will actually change their trajectory. GMAC’s 2026 Prospective Students Survey found that 46% of candidates globally cited cost as a top barrier to graduate management education, while 20% cited uncertainty about job prospects after graduation. That tells you something important: applicants are no longer asking only, “Can I get in?” They are also asking, “Will this make financial and professional sense?”"}],["$","p","That is exactly the right shift.",{"children":"That is exactly the right shift."}],["$","p","A good MBA can absolutely be worth it. It can accelerate your salary, expand your network, make a difficult career pivot possible, and give you access to employers who would otherwise be hard to reach.",{"children":"A good MBA can absolutely be worth it. It can accelerate your salary, expand your network, make a difficult career pivot possible, and give you access to employers who would otherwise be hard to reach."}],"$L5","$L6"],"$L7"]}],"$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le","$Lf","$L10","$L11","$L12","$L13","$L14","$L15","$L16","$L17","$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23","$L24","$L25","$L26","$L27","$L28","$L29","$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d","$L2e","$L2f"]}],"$L30"]}]}],"$L31"]}],["$L32"],"$L33"]}],"isPartial":"$@34","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L36","isPartial":"$@37","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":null},{"rsc":"$L38","isPartial":"$@39","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":"$3a"},{"rsc":"$L3b","isPartial":"$@3c","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":"$3a"},{"rsc":"$L3d","isPartial":"$@3e","staleTime":"$35","varyParams":null}],"isUpgradeableISRFallback":false,"a":"$@3f","rootVaryParams":null,"needsRuntimeRequest":"$@40"}
