5:["$","p","But “worth it” depends on where you are starting, where you want to end up, how much you spend, how long you step out of the workforce, and whether the school actually has a track record of taking people like you to the places you want to go.",{"children":"But “worth it” depends on where you are starting, where you want to end up, how much you spend, how long you step out of the workforce, and whether the school actually has a track record of taking people like you to the places you want to go."}]
6:["$","p","Here is a simple framework to find that out.",{"children":"Here is a simple framework to find that out."}]
7:["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]
8:["$","section","Step 1: Define Your “After” With Precision",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 1: Define Your “After” With Precision"}],[["$","p","Before calculating return, you need to know what you are returning to.",{"children":"Before calculating return, you need to know what you are returning to."}],["$","p","This is where a lot of applicants go wrong. They use broad, impressive-sounding goals that are too vague to evaluate properly.",{"children":"This is where a lot of applicants go wrong. They use broad, impressive-sounding goals that are too vague to evaluate properly."}],["$","p","They say:",{"children":"They say:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
9:["$","section","“I want leadership exposure.”",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"“I want leadership exposure.”"}],[["$","p","“I want international opportunities.”",{"children":"“I want international opportunities.”"}],["$","p","“I want a better career.”",{"children":"“I want a better career.”"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
a:["$","section","“I want to move into business.”",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"“I want to move into business.”"}],[["$","p","None of that is useless. But none of it is precise enough to justify spending tens of thousands, or in some cases hundreds of thousands, on an MBA.",{"children":"None of that is useless. But none of it is precise enough to justify spending tens of thousands, or in some cases hundreds of thousands, on an MBA."}],["$","p","A stronger approach is to define your “after” in concrete terms:",{"children":"A stronger approach is to define your “after” in concrete terms:"}],["$","p","Industry:",{"children":"Industry:"}],["$","p","Consulting / Fintech / Finance / Tech / Luxury / Healthcare / Energy",{"children":"Consulting / Fintech / Finance / Tech / Luxury / Healthcare / Energy"}],["$","p","Function:",{"children":"Function:"}],["$","p","Strategy / Product / Investment / Operations / Marketing / General Management",{"children":"Strategy / Product / Investment / Operations / Marketing / General Management"}],["$","p","Geography:",{"children":"Geography:"}],["$","p","Europe / North America / Southeast Asia / Middle East / India",{"children":"Europe / North America / Southeast Asia / Middle East / India"}],["$","p","Seniority in 5 years:",{"children":"Seniority in 5 years:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
b:["$","section","Manager / Director-track / Founder / Principal / Functional Leader",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Manager / Director-track / Founder / Principal / Functional Leader"}],[["$","p","That level of clarity changes everything.",{"children":"That level of clarity changes everything."}],["$","p","Because ROI is never abstract. It is personal.",{"children":"Because ROI is never abstract. It is personal."}],["$","p","A student trying to move from engineering into consulting in Germany is solving a very different problem from someone trying to move from marketing into product roles in the Netherlands. A candidate hoping to break into private equity has a different ROI lens from someone who wants to return to a family business with better strategic and financial training.",{"children":"A student trying to move from engineering into consulting in Germany is solving a very different problem from someone trying to move from marketing into product roles in the Netherlands. A candidate hoping to break into private equity has a different ROI lens from someone who wants to return to a family business with better strategic and financial training."}],["$","p","If you do not define the destination clearly, almost any MBA can look attractive. Once you define it, some programs immediately stop making sense.",{"children":"If you do not define the destination clearly, almost any MBA can look attractive. Once you define it, some programs immediately stop making sense."}],["$","p","Example",{"children":"Example"}],["$","p","Take two applicants:",{"children":"Take two applicants:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
c:["$","section","Applicant A says: “I want an MBA because I feel stuck and want growth.”",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Applicant A says: “I want an MBA because I feel stuck and want growth.”"}],[["$","p","Applicant B says: “I want to move from operations into strategy consulting, preferably in Western Europe, and I want to be on a manager-track path within five years.”",{"children":"Applicant B says: “I want to move from operations into strategy consulting, preferably in Western Europe, and I want to be on a manager-track path within five years.”"}],["$","p","Applicant B is already in a much stronger decision-making position.",{"children":"Applicant B is already in a much stronger decision-making position."}],["$","p","Why? Because now they can ask useful questions:",{"children":"Why? Because now they can ask useful questions:"}],["$","p","Which schools place into consulting in Europe?",{"children":"Which schools place into consulting in Europe?"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
d:["$","section","Which firms recruit there?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Which firms recruit there?"}],[["$","p","How many alumni are in those offices?",{"children":"How many alumni are in those offices?"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
e:["$","section","What is the likely salary jump?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What is the likely salary jump?"}],[["$","p","How long would it take to recover the investment?",{"children":"How long would it take to recover the investment?"}],["$","p","That is how ROI thinking starts.",{"children":"That is how ROI thinking starts."}],["$","p","Counterpoint",{"children":"Counterpoint"}],["$","p","Not everyone has total clarity at the beginning, and that is fine. Some people genuinely use the MBA to explore. But there is a difference between being open-minded and being undefined.",{"children":"Not everyone has total clarity at the beginning, and that is fine. Some people genuinely use the MBA to explore. But there is a difference between being open-minded and being undefined."}],["$","p","If you still cannot describe the role, geography, and industry you are targeting, you need to ask a harder question:",{"children":"If you still cannot describe the role, geography, and industry you are targeting, you need to ask a harder question:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
f:["$","section","Do I need an MBA right now, or do I need more clarity first?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Do I need an MBA right now, or do I need more clarity first?"}],[["$","p","In some cases, a specialized Master’s may serve you better than an MBA at this stage, especially if your next step depends more on technical depth than on general management signaling.",{"children":"In some cases, a specialized Master’s may serve you better than an MBA at this stage, especially if your next step depends more on technical depth than on general management signaling."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
10:["$","section","Step 2: Map the School’s Alumni to Your Target",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 2: Map the School’s Alumni to Your Target"}],[["$","p","This is the most underused tool available to every applicant and it takes about three hours on LinkedIn.",{"children":"This is the most underused tool available to every applicant and it takes about three hours on LinkedIn."}],["$","p","Search alumni from your target school who graduated in the last five years. Filter by your target:",{"children":"Search alumni from your target school who graduated in the last five years. Filter by your target:"}],["$","p","industry",{"children":"industry"}],["$","p","company",{"children":"company"}],["$","p","function",{"children":"function"}],["$","p","country",{"children":"country"}],["$","p","city",{"children":"city"}],["$","p","Then count what you find.",{"children":"Then count what you find."}],["$","p","Not in a casual, “I saw a few people there” way. Count properly.",{"children":"Not in a casual, “I saw a few people there” way. Count properly."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
11:["$","section","How many alumni from that school are actually working where you want to work?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How many alumni from that school are actually working where you want to work?"}],[["$","p","That is one of the clearest indicators of whether the MBA is likely to deliver on your goal.",{"children":"That is one of the clearest indicators of whether the MBA is likely to deliver on your goal."}],["$","p","Why this matters",{"children":"Why this matters"}],["$","p","A school ranked #8 globally with 12 alumni in your target sector and city may be worth less to you than a school ranked #22 with 400 alumni in exactly the firms, offices, and roles you care about.",{"children":"A school ranked #8 globally with 12 alumni in your target sector and city may be worth less to you than a school ranked #22 with 400 alumni in exactly the firms, offices, and roles you care about."}],["$","p","That does not mean rankings do not matter. They do. Rankings affect employer perception, applicant quality, and brand value.",{"children":"That does not mean rankings do not matter. They do. Rankings affect employer perception, applicant quality, and brand value."}],["$","p","But rankings are broad signals. Your career is specific.",{"children":"But rankings are broad signals. Your career is specific."}],["$","p","The alumni network in your specific target is your real asset. Not the ranking.",{"children":"The alumni network in your specific target is your real asset. Not the ranking."}],["$","p","That network shapes:",{"children":"That network shapes:"}],["$","p","who responds to your cold messages",{"children":"who responds to your cold messages"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
12:["$","section","what kinds of internships and interviews are realistically accessible",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"what kinds of internships and interviews are realistically accessible"}],[["$","p","whether the school has real relevance in your target geography",{"children":"whether the school has real relevance in your target geography"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
13:["$","section","Student decision scenario",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Student decision scenario"}],[["$","p","Imagine you want to work in European fintech. You compare two schools: one has stronger global prestige, the other has visibly stronger alumni density in Amsterdam, Berlin, Paris, Luxembourg, and London fintech roles.",{"children":"Imagine you want to work in European fintech. You compare two schools: one has stronger global prestige, the other has visibly stronger alumni density in Amsterdam, Berlin, Paris, Luxembourg, and London fintech roles."}],["$","p","If your goal is highly targeted and Europe-specific, the second school may produce stronger ROI even if it is less glamorous in a general ranking table.",{"children":"If your goal is highly targeted and Europe-specific, the second school may produce stronger ROI even if it is less glamorous in a general ranking table."}],["$","p","That is not a downgrade. That is precision.",{"children":"That is not a downgrade. That is precision."}],["$","p","Counterpoint",{"children":"Counterpoint"}],["$","p","There is one important caution here: alumni mapping is useful, but it is not the same as guaranteed placement.",{"children":"There is one important caution here: alumni mapping is useful, but it is not the same as guaranteed placement."}],["$","p","A school may have strong alumni presence in a sector because it attracts people who were already good candidates for that sector. In finance especially, prior profile matters a lot. So do not read the data too casually.",{"children":"A school may have strong alumni presence in a sector because it attracts people who were already good candidates for that sector. In finance especially, prior profile matters a lot. So do not read the data too casually."}],["$","p","Use alumni mapping as evidence of relevance, not proof of inevitability.",{"children":"Use alumni mapping as evidence of relevance, not proof of inevitability."}],["$","p","A better way to interpret it is:",{"children":"A better way to interpret it is:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
14:["$","section","Is the network deep enough to create real access?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is the network deep enough to create real access?"}],[["$","p","That is the level of reading you want.",{"children":"That is the level of reading you want."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
15:["$","section","Step 3: Calculate Your Full Investment",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 3: Calculate Your Full Investment"}],[["$","p","Tuition is the number schools advertise. It is not the number that matters most.",{"children":"Tuition is the number schools advertise. It is not the number that matters most."}],["$","p","The real number is:",{"children":"The real number is:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
16:["$","section","Real Investment = Tuition + Living Costs + Lost Earnings",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Real Investment = Tuition + Living Costs + Lost Earnings"}],[["$","p","That third number is the one many students underestimate.",{"children":"That third number is the one many students underestimate."}],["$","p","If you leave a job to study full-time, the salary you are not earning is part of the cost. So are foregone bonuses, promotion cycles, and the momentum you would otherwise carry in the workforce.",{"children":"If you leave a job to study full-time, the salary you are not earning is part of the cost. So are foregone bonuses, promotion cycles, and the momentum you would otherwise carry in the workforce."}],["$","p","This is why program duration matters so much.",{"children":"This is why program duration matters so much."}],["$","p","Illustrative example",{"children":"Illustrative example"}],["$","p","2-Year US MBA",{"children":"2-Year US MBA"}],["$","p","Tuition: $120,000",{"children":"Tuition: $120,000"}],["$","p","Living costs: $60,000",{"children":"Living costs: $60,000"}],["$","p","Lost earnings: $48,000",{"children":"Lost earnings: $48,000"}],["$","p","Total: $228,000",{"children":"Total: $228,000"}],["$","p","1-Year European MBA",{"children":"1-Year European MBA"}],["$","p","Tuition: €45,000",{"children":"Tuition: €45,000"}],["$","p","Living costs: €18,000",{"children":"Living costs: €18,000"}],["$","p","Lost earnings: €20,000",{"children":"Lost earnings: €20,000"}],["$","p","Total: €83,000",{"children":"Total: €83,000"}],["$","p","These are illustrative numbers, not universal benchmarks. Real totals vary by school, scholarship, city, housing situation, and pre-MBA salary.",{"children":"These are illustrative numbers, not universal benchmarks. Real totals vary by school, scholarship, city, housing situation, and pre-MBA salary."}],["$","p","But the framework is correct. The longer the program, the more the economics shift.",{"children":"But the framework is correct. The longer the program, the more the economics shift."}],["$","p","That is why a one-year MBA can sometimes outperform a two-year MBA on ROI, especially if the target post-MBA market is similar.",{"children":"That is why a one-year MBA can sometimes outperform a two-year MBA on ROI, especially if the target post-MBA market is similar."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
17:["$","section","What applicants often miss",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What applicants often miss"}],[["$","p","Many students fixate on the prestige of a program and ignore how much extra cost they are absorbing for that prestige.",{"children":"Many students fixate on the prestige of a program and ignore how much extra cost they are absorbing for that prestige."}],["$","p","Sometimes that extra cost is worth it. Sometimes it buys access to a different recruiter set, a different geography, or a far stronger long-term network.",{"children":"Sometimes that extra cost is worth it. Sometimes it buys access to a different recruiter set, a different geography, or a far stronger long-term network."}],["$","p","But sometimes it does not. Sometimes it is just a more expensive route to a very similar destination.",{"children":"But sometimes it does not. Sometimes it is just a more expensive route to a very similar destination."}],["$","p","That is what you need to test.",{"children":"That is what you need to test."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
18:["$","section","Student decision scenario",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Student decision scenario"}],[["$","p","Suppose two applicants want to pivot into consulting in Europe. One chooses a longer, more expensive MBA outside Europe. The other chooses a one-year European MBA with a strong local employer network.",{"children":"Suppose two applicants want to pivot into consulting in Europe. One chooses a longer, more expensive MBA outside Europe. The other chooses a one-year European MBA with a strong local employer network."}],["$","p","If both end up in comparable consulting salary bands in Europe, the second candidate may recover the investment much faster, take on less debt, and preserve more financial flexibility in the first few years after graduation.",{"children":"If both end up in comparable consulting salary bands in Europe, the second candidate may recover the investment much faster, take on less debt, and preserve more financial flexibility in the first few years after graduation."}],["$","p","That does not mean the cheaper option is automatically better. The more expensive one may offer broader optionality or stronger global brand value. But the comparison needs to be explicit, not assumed.",{"children":"That does not mean the cheaper option is automatically better. The more expensive one may offer broader optionality or stronger global brand value. But the comparison needs to be explicit, not assumed."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
19:["$","section","Step 4: Calculate Your Payback Period",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 4: Calculate Your Payback Period"}],[["$","p","Once you know the total cost, the next step is simple:",{"children":"Once you know the total cost, the next step is simple:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1a:["$","section","Payback Period = Total Investment ÷ Annual Salary Increase",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Payback Period = Total Investment ÷ Annual Salary Increase"}],[["$","p","This is not the only way to measure ROI, but it is one of the clearest.",{"children":"This is not the only way to measure ROI, but it is one of the clearest."}],["$","p","Example",{"children":"Example"}],["$","p","A student currently earning €30,000 completes a one-year MBA and enters consulting at €75,000.",{"children":"A student currently earning €30,000 completes a one-year MBA and enters consulting at €75,000."}],["$","p","Annual salary increase: €45,000",{"children":"Annual salary increase: €45,000"}],["$","p","Total investment: €83,000",{"children":"Total investment: €83,000"}],["$","p","Payback period: under 2 years",{"children":"Payback period: under 2 years"}],["$","p","That is strong ROI.",{"children":"That is strong ROI."}],["$","p","As a working rule:",{"children":"As a working rule:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1b:["$","section","3 to 5 years may still be reasonable, especially for a serious pivot",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"3 to 5 years may still be reasonable, especially for a serious pivot"}],[["$","p","Beyond 5 to 6 years deserves a much harder look",{"children":"Beyond 5 to 6 years deserves a much harder look"}],["$","p","Why this matters",{"children":"Why this matters"}],["$","p","Payback period forces discipline. It moves the conversation away from “this school feels prestigious” and toward “this decision has a recoverable timeline.”",{"children":"Payback period forces discipline. It moves the conversation away from “this school feels prestigious” and toward “this decision has a recoverable timeline.”"}],["$","p","If the payback period is long, the MBA may still be worth it. But now you need a better reason:",{"children":"If the payback period is long, the MBA may still be worth it. But now you need a better reason:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1c:["$","section","Is it opening a geography or sector that changes your career path materially?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is it opening a geography or sector that changes your career path materially?"}],[["$","p","If the answer is no, you may be overpaying for the signal.",{"children":"If the answer is no, you may be overpaying for the signal."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1d:["$","section","Counterpoint: payback is not everything",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Counterpoint: payback is not everything"}],[["$","p","A short payback period is attractive, but it is not the whole story.",{"children":"A short payback period is attractive, but it is not the whole story."}],["$","p","Some students choose an MBA because it changes the shape of their career, not just the first-year salary. For example:",{"children":"Some students choose an MBA because it changes the shape of their career, not just the first-year salary. For example:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1e:["$","section","someone moving into a founder or investor ecosystem",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"someone moving into a founder or investor ecosystem"}],[["$","p","In those cases, the ROI may compound over time rather than showing up fully in year one.",{"children":"In those cases, the ROI may compound over time rather than showing up fully in year one."}],["$","p","Still, if the payback period is weak and the strategic upside is also unclear, the decision deserves more skepticism.",{"children":"Still, if the payback period is weak and the strategic upside is also unclear, the decision deserves more skepticism."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","Step 5: Don’t Ignore the Non-Financial Return",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Step 5: Don’t Ignore the Non-Financial Return"}],[["$","p","Three factors do not always show up neatly in salary comparisons, but they can significantly shift your ROI.",{"children":"Three factors do not always show up neatly in salary comparisons, but they can significantly shift your ROI."}],["$","p","For many students, the MBA is not mainly about a salary increase. It is about changing lanes faster than they could on their own.",{"children":"For many students, the MBA is not mainly about a salary increase. It is about changing lanes faster than they could on their own."}],["$","p","An MBA can be the fastest route:",{"children":"An MBA can be the fastest route:"}],["$","p","from engineering into consulting",{"children":"from engineering into consulting"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Career pivot access",{"children":"Career pivot access"}]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","from a local market into a global one",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"from a local market into a global one"}],[["$","p","If it compresses a transition that would otherwise take three to five years, that has real value.",{"children":"If it compresses a transition that would otherwise take three to five years, that has real value."}],["$","p","A candidate in a back-end operations role may not be badly paid, but may have very limited access to strategy-track roles. If the MBA helps them break into a consulting or general management path with far stronger long-term growth, the early ROI may undersell the true return.",{"children":"A candidate in a back-end operations role may not be badly paid, but may have very limited access to strategy-track roles. If the MBA helps them break into a consulting or general management path with far stronger long-term growth, the early ROI may undersell the true return."}],["$","p","For international students, this can materially affect ROI. As of May 19, 2026:",{"children":"For international students, this can materially affect ROI. As of May 19, 2026:"}],["$","p","Germany generally allows graduates to stay for up to 18 months to look for skilled employment after completing a German degree.",{"children":"Germany generally allows graduates to stay for up to 18 months to look for skilled employment after completing a German degree."}],["$","p","The Netherlands offers an orientation year residence permit valid for 1 year.",{"children":"The Netherlands offers an orientation year residence permit valid for 1 year."}],["$","p","France generally offers eligible graduates a 1-year post-study job-search or business-creation route.",{"children":"France generally offers eligible graduates a 1-year post-study job-search or business-creation route."}],["$","p","These rules matter because time to secure the right job is part of the return. A degree is more valuable when it gives you a realistic runway to convert education into employment. A shorter or more restrictive route can change the risk profile significantly.",{"children":"These rules matter because time to secure the right job is part of the return. A degree is more valuable when it gives you a realistic runway to convert education into employment. A shorter or more restrictive route can change the risk profile significantly."}],["$","p","This is also one place where students should be careful about recycled advice online. Visa frameworks change. Country-specific rules should always be checked close to the application stage.",{"children":"This is also one place where students should be careful about recycled advice online. Visa frameworks change. Country-specific rules should always be checked close to the application stage."}],["$","p","A strong alumni network keeps paying dividends long after the first job. It matters when:",{"children":"A strong alumni network keeps paying dividends long after the first job. It matters when:"}],["$","p","you want to change companies",{"children":"you want to change companies"}],["$","p","you want to change countries",{"children":"you want to change countries"}],["$","p","you are fundraising",{"children":"you are fundraising"}],["$","p","you are hiring",{"children":"you are hiring"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","Post-study visa access",{"children":"Post-study visa access"}],["$","li","Network compounding",{"children":"Network compounding"}]]}]]}]
21:["$","section","you need fast, trusted industry insight",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"you need fast, trusted industry insight"}],[["$","p","This is why one of the best questions you can ask alumni is:",{"children":"This is why one of the best questions you can ask alumni is:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
22:["$","section","How often do you actually use your school’s network professionally?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How often do you actually use your school’s network professionally?"}],[["$","p","Not whether they “liked the community.” Not whether they “met great people.” Whether the network actually helped in practical career terms. That is the answer that matters.",{"children":"Not whether they “liked the community.” Not whether they “met great people.” Whether the network actually helped in practical career terms. That is the answer that matters."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
23:["$","section","Which MBA Fits Your Career Line?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Which MBA Fits Your Career Line?"}],[["$","p","Different goals require different kinds of schools and different evaluation criteria.",{"children":"Different goals require different kinds of schools and different evaluation criteria."}],["$","p","Consulting",{"children":"Consulting"}],["$","p","If you are targeting consulting, prioritize:",{"children":"If you are targeting consulting, prioritize:"}],["$","p","schools with visible recruiter access",{"children":"schools with visible recruiter access"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
24:["$","section","strong case interview preparation culture",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"strong case interview preparation culture"}],[["$","p","Programs such as HEC Paris, INSEAD, and London Business School are regularly part of this conversation in Europe because of their employer visibility and network strength.",{"children":"Programs such as HEC Paris, INSEAD, and London Business School are regularly part of this conversation in Europe because of their employer visibility and network strength."}],["$","p","Finance / PE",{"children":"Finance / PE"}],["$","p","If you are targeting finance or private equity, prioritize:",{"children":"If you are targeting finance or private equity, prioritize:"}],["$","p","alumni in relevant funds and financial hubs",{"children":"alumni in relevant funds and financial hubs"}],["$","p","location strength",{"children":"location strength"}],["$","p","employer access",{"children":"employer access"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
25:["$","section","your own pre-MBA profile fit",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"your own pre-MBA profile fit"}],[["$","p","Finance ROI is often highly dependent on prior experience, not just the school.",{"children":"Finance ROI is often highly dependent on prior experience, not just the school."}],["$","p","Tech / Product",{"children":"Tech / Product"}],["$","p","If you want tech or product roles, look beyond general prestige and ask:",{"children":"If you want tech or product roles, look beyond general prestige and ask:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
26:["$","section","which geographies actually make sense for my post-MBA target?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"which geographies actually make sense for my post-MBA target?"}],[["$","p","does the school have product-focused alumni I can map?",{"children":"does the school have product-focused alumni I can map?"}],["$","p","Entrepreneurship",{"children":"Entrepreneurship"}],["$","p","If you want to build something, employer salary may matter less than:",{"children":"If you want to build something, employer salary may matter less than:"}],["$","p","founder network",{"children":"founder network"}],["$","p","incubator support",{"children":"incubator support"}],["$","p","investor access",{"children":"investor access"}],["$","p","quality of peers",{"children":"quality of peers"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
27:["$","section","ecosystem relevance",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"ecosystem relevance"}],[["$","p","Again, this is why ROI must be personal.",{"children":"Again, this is why ROI must be personal."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
28:["$","section","Before You Apply: A Quick Checklist",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before You Apply: A Quick Checklist"}],[["$","p","Before you commit to an MBA, ask yourself:",{"children":"Before you commit to an MBA, ask yourself:"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
29:["$","section","Verified current post-study work options in your target country",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Verified current post-study work options in your target country"}],[["$","p","If you have not done these things yet, you are still looking at MBAs. You are not really evaluating them.",{"children":"If you have not done these things yet, you are still looking at MBAs. You are not really evaluating them."}],["$","p","Final Thought",{"children":"Final Thought"}],["$","p","The students who get the best return from business school are not always the ones who got into the highest-ranked program.",{"children":"The students who get the best return from business school are not always the ones who got into the highest-ranked program."}],["$","p","They are the ones who chose with precision.",{"children":"They are the ones who chose with precision."}],["$","p","They asked where they wanted to go.",{"children":"They asked where they wanted to go."}],["$","p","They checked which school actually led there.",{"children":"They checked which school actually led there."}],["$","p","They counted the full cost.",{"children":"They counted the full cost."}],["$","p","They measured the payback.",{"children":"They measured the payback."}],["$","p","They talked to alumni.",{"children":"They talked to alumni."}],["$","p","And they treated the MBA as a strategic investment, not a prestige purchase.",{"children":"And they treated the MBA as a strategic investment, not a prestige purchase."}],["$","p","That is the ROI question. Ask it early. Run the numbers honestly. Talk to the alumni. Then decide.",{"children":"That is the ROI question. Ask it early. Run the numbers honestly. Talk to the alumni. Then decide."}],["$","p","FAQ",{"children":"FAQ"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2a:["$","section","Is an MBA worth it financially?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is an MBA worth it financially?"}],[["$","p","An MBA can be worth it financially if the degree leads to a meaningful salary increase, stronger long-term career access, or a faster career pivot that justifies the total cost.",{"children":"An MBA can be worth it financially if the degree leads to a meaningful salary increase, stronger long-term career access, or a faster career pivot that justifies the total cost."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2b:["$","section","How do you calculate MBA ROI?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How do you calculate MBA ROI?"}],[["$","p","A practical MBA ROI formula is total investment divided by annual salary increase. Total investment should include tuition, living costs, and lost earnings while studying.",{"children":"A practical MBA ROI formula is total investment divided by annual salary increase. Total investment should include tuition, living costs, and lost earnings while studying."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2c:["$","section","What is a good MBA payback period?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What is a good MBA payback period?"}],[["$","p","A payback period under three years is often considered strong, while a payback period above five to six years usually deserves closer scrutiny.",{"children":"A payback period under three years is often considered strong, while a payback period above five to six years usually deserves closer scrutiny."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2d:["$","section","Does ranking matter when choosing an MBA?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Does ranking matter when choosing an MBA?"}],[["$","p","Ranking matters, but it should not be the only factor. Alumni outcomes, employer access, network strength, and target geography often matter more for actual ROI.",{"children":"Ranking matters, but it should not be the only factor. Alumni outcomes, employer access, network strength, and target geography often matter more for actual ROI."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2e:["$","section","Is a one-year MBA better for ROI?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Is a one-year MBA better for ROI?"}],[["$","p","A one-year MBA can produce better ROI when it reduces tuition costs, living costs, and lost earnings while still delivering strong career outcomes in the target market.",{"children":"A one-year MBA can produce better ROI when it reduces tuition costs, living costs, and lost earnings while still delivering strong career outcomes in the target market."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
2f:["$","section","What matters more: MBA prestige or MBA outcomes?",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What matters more: MBA prestige or MBA outcomes?"}],[["$","p","For ROI, outcomes matter more. A school’s value depends on whether it helps you reach your target role, industry, and geography at a justifiable cost.",{"children":"For ROI, outcomes matter more. A school’s value depends on whether it helps you reach your target role, industry, and geography at a justifiable cost."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
